multi-agent collaboration, workflow automation orchestration, local-first architecture with privacy focus, and Rust-based runtime.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Tartarus-AI/tartarusai-cli\" target=\"_blank\">TartarusAI CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Uncensored AI coding agent that runs in your terminal with 256K context window, featuring crypto-only billing and designed to complete coding tasks without refusal.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-20</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"column whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Whitelist Updates</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/enterprise-organizations\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Organizations for Cursor Enterprise</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enterprise customers can now manage multiple Cursor teams from one place, with different security, governance, budget, and feature controls for each.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-06-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://devin.ai/desktop\" target=\"_blank\">Devin: Devin Desktop GA Release</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Devin Desktop is now generally available, allowing developers to manage fleets of local and cloud agents from one surface.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-06-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://devin.ai/desktop\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf: Windsurf is now Devin Desktop</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Windsurf has been rebranded to Devin Desktop, maintaining the IDE features users love while adding more capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-06-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\"What? Devin is still alive? Is the same devin from 2 years ago?\" - HN</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/auto-review\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Auto-review Run Mode (v3.6)</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New auto-review run mode that allows Cursor to work for longer with fewer approval prompts and safer execution.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/shared-canvases\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Shared Canvases and /loop Skill (v3.5)</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introduced Shared Canvases feature and the /loop skill for local long-running agents with recurring tasks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-20</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/05-20-26\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Cursor Automations Improvements (v3.5)</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cursor Automations is now available in the Agents Window with ability to configure automations with multiple attached repos.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-20</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/05-19-26\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Cursor in Jira Integration</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cursor is now available as an integration in Jira. Requires Cursor admin access and Jira Commercial Cloud with Rovo enabled.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-19</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights</div>\n                <div class=\"empty-state\">No insights gathered for this report.</div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>Report generated by <a href=\"#\">Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by Claude Agent SDK</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
