eature</span>\n   403→                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-20</span>\n   404→                    </div>\n   405→                </div>\n   406→\n   407→                <div class=\"item\">\n   408→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   409→                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/05-20-26\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Cursor Automations Improvements (v3.5)</a>\n   410→                    </div>\n   411→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   412→                        Cursor Automations is now available in the Agents Window with ability to configure automations with multiple attached repos.\n   413→                    </div>\n   414→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   415→                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n   416→                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-20</span>\n   417→                    </div>\n   418→                </div>\n   419→\n   420→                <div class=\"item\">\n   421→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   422→                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/05-19-26\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Cursor in Jira Integration</a>\n   423→                    </div>\n   424→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   425→                        Cursor is now available as an integration in Jira. Requires Cursor admin access and Jira Commercial Cloud with Rovo enabled.\n   426→                    </div>\n   427→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   428→                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n   429→                        <span class=\"date\">2026-05-19</span>\n   430→                    </div>\n   431→                </div>\n   432→            </section>\n   433→\n   434→            <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n   435→                <div class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights</div>\n   436→                <div clas